{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "5103699183032387cb0ce89f588b05d672f691c65f241701807272702afde112", "ja": "開幕！　アイドルの祭典！", "zh": "开幕！偶像的祭典！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "007b00f0d51b703f0aec318ce1ab2edcf81959db588b1ffb9fa59e7084d10e7e", "ja": "劇場の代表として、夏の一大イベント、アイ\nドルサマーフェスティバルに出場することに\nなった、昴、百合子、恵美、ひなた、可憐の\n5人。大きすぎる会場に迷っていると、圧倒\n的なオーラを放つ少女・詩花と出会う。", "zh": "昴、百合子、惠美、日向、可怜这五个人，\n获选代表剧场参加夏日盛典「偶像夏日祭」。\n但是一行人却在偌大的会场中迷路，\n并邂逅了浑身散发惊人气场的少女──诗花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "219bcda957abfe1a576efd4d844fa5a3e5fbbe2b6dac9e81eec16d40e01c8b98", "ja": "（アイドルたちの熱い夏……\nアイドルサマーフェスティバルが、いよいよ始まる！）", "zh": "（偶像们的炎热夏日……\n偶像夏日祭终于要开始了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "ba525c7e50c5b82afa07ffa4aefe08a631e760df8b8c05255a6b954b733a91ae", "ja": "すっげー！　この会場、メチャクチャでかいじゃん！\nそれに……！", "zh": "好厉害喔！这个会场超大的耶！\n而且……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "bb540f45d86b5b93f0be809810e76ca08e65290739d42abd24c2e382721e64ae", "ja": "人気アイドルが集まるって、ホントだったんだな！\nどっち向いても、かわいい子ばっかりだよ！", "zh": "真的有很多人气偶像都来了耶！\n放眼望去都是可爱的女生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "e4247651691cdd2cc6aa365101f88ca8101597cd9522f52d825ee07b0ce55172", "ja": "ほんとだねぇ、昴さん。\nあたし、なんだかクラクラしてきたよぉ。", "zh": "就是说呢～昴。\n我都眼花撩乱了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "8f84500db9f173d50f62ad4556aadf5590458eaea0db876f4d95aad036bcd231", "ja": "うぅ、人気のアイドルばかり……。\nわ、私たち、こんな中で、目立てるんでしょうか……？", "zh": "呜呜，四处都是人气偶像……\n我、我们在这里是不是很突兀……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "8bb1bccdbe42f074350a34eb548dbba6148900aef3f5877edf9064704ef04e15", "ja": "もう、しっかりしなよ！　アタシらだって、そんな……\nそんなには、負けてないって多分。ね、そうだよね？", "zh": "真是的，你们振作点啦！我们也……\n也没输人家那么多啊，大概啦。欸，你说对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b4ac00a50cbfad977b6b60bb8a027009d84e1a95b694bba1efdd2cfbf158450a", "ja": "ああ、今はちょっと負けてるだけだ。\nだってみんなは、これから追い抜く立場だからな！", "zh": "对啊，现在只是略逊一筹罢了，\n因为你们今后要超越她们啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "c904f00531f08a35cbab24ced198f4ad41f3a43af0561bef24fb2b5fa2fc60b7", "ja": "うう、そんな簡単に追い抜けるでしょうか……。\n私、走るのは速くないんですけど……。", "zh": "呜呜，有那么容易超越吗……\n我跑得又不快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d552906421e894e889e90785e97107033b912cc0b1a63e29a8fec9f1cc890947", "ja": "そういう速度は関係ないから大丈夫だ。\nでもまあ、そんなに不安なら……そうだな。", "zh": "这和脚程无关，放心吧。\n不过，看你们这么不安……不如这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a73a5f19ccd53c9ccc4a701af67a5b9b60679c531f79de077fd1f553bef59afb", "ja": "俺は本当に、みんなの可能性を信じてるんだ。\nみんなと出会った日から、疑ったこともない。", "zh": "我是真心相信你们有潜力。\n自从认识你们之后，从未有过一丝怀疑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "90edb436e007488a865100c2587deb1d43e458aa1c5a41615af2ff2398e085ee", "ja": "だから……\nみんなも、俺を信じてみないか？", "zh": "所以……\n你们也试着相信我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "8a458d3ce80b2b171d523524c733cad14668e4f336e242f6afc2c62d2057b434", "ja": "プロデューサー……！", "zh": "制作人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "8a458d3ce80b2b171d523524c733cad14668e4f336e242f6afc2c62d2057b434", "ja": "プロデューサー……！", "zh": "制作人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "2b57f623f271ae34bdce4ed802addf386c7e1945aac0a63709b23538a0ed2705", "ja": "プロデューサーさん……！", "zh": "制作人先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "aec050faf15126772cd2510b20dc5f42f454f1402ea5706f16a6ebf7ddd2dbfd", "ja": "にゃははっ♪　そこまで言われちゃ、ビシッと\n気合い入れ直すしかないよねっ。ね、みんな？", "zh": "呀哈哈♪既然制作人都这么说了，\n那我们可得重新打起精神才行！对吧，各位？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9db5cbfe19c4e008010531da306283bbc3391f6dcacf4f93599de7a3affbe68", "ja": "うんっ！　オレも……じゃなかった、わたしも！\n立派なアイドルとして、かっとばしてやる！　……わ！", "zh": "嗯！我也……不对，人家也是！\n要做为一位出色的偶像，一棒扛出去……唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "8f379131d08e70a2572dededf05fbcdb4215adf93430faca9b6cf7fedcc199df", "ja": "あ、と、ところで、{$P$}さん。\n春香さんのことは……ここで待ってればいいんですか？", "zh": "啊，对、对了，{$P$}先生。\n春香呢……我们在这里等她就行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0b827c26feb801e30d0fd574248ecae6aaf3ae2faf313ab125d5a029f6949749", "ja": "ああ、春香は今日出番がないから、後日合流する\n予定なんだ。とりあえず、控え室に向かおう！", "zh": "啊，春香她今天没有要上场，明后天才要和她会合。\n总之，我们先过去准备室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "0dc5a3036d319a95019870e700c3d4135fcccda11fb055747d18068d3c2c3022", "ja": "って、{$P$}、まだ着かないのか？\nオレ、ノドかわいてきちゃったよ～。", "zh": "欸，{$P$}，还没到吗？\n我都走到口渴了啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9ef666c3bbb2d96eb164601439c26a2cf846bcffed85d6d77c85e94ff6ed2d9a", "ja": "う、うーん、おかしいな。\nこの辺りのはずなんだが……ええと……。", "zh": "唔、唔～，真是怪了。\n应该就在这附近才对啊……我看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "ea86e31d47013502bb642910fad092356de3dae9fca797c5f86e55f70080902f", "ja": "なんだか、同じ所をぐるぐる回ってるような\n気がするべさ……。", "zh": "感觉我们好像一直在同一个地方打转哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "83dbb1c04759f2a0b849df0ea220324892f06cb70d2b12de7c1dc55d63647712", "ja": "も～、この会場、広すぎだよ～！\nチャリに乗ってくれば良かったかな？", "zh": "真是的～这个会场太大了啦～！\n是不是应该骑脚踏车来啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "874b733f83c74a6df01e4e922972fcf2505a2fafe52642d3f42e203f4c330d03", "ja": "ハッ！？　もしかして私たち、いつの間にか\nループする世界に迷い込んでしまったのでは！？", "zh": "啊！莫非我们在不知不觉间，\n误闯了无限回圈的世界！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "cbfdc5f2dbdd34ac5049c4f96201e7459da6227e3c6e32a5d8460458707b7b36", "ja": "そういうイベントじゃないはずだが……よし、ちょっと\nスタッフに聞いてくる。みんなはここで待っててくれ！", "zh": "这里办的不是那种活动吧……\n好吧，我去问问工作人员，你们先在这里等我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1032_047sub", "source_sha256": "7a6b1a4202cf46cadfc861a4a74f2e8a1fdd418af96e23acabc4232ab800079a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nうわ、すげー速さで行っちゃった……大丈夫かな～？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n哇，他用冲的跑掉了……不要紧吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "4ad1ee4da678300c9b814f2262c8b4df00960d36f9a1673962b69868ce65737b", "ja": "あ、あの……さっきの場所で待ってなくて\n本当に、よ、よかったのかな……？", "zh": "那、那个……我们没有留在原地等制作人，\n这样子，真、真的好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1034_047sub", "source_sha256": "ba5ec5e2fe2e9bcd6b10dd24d8c240a46b02a308ac28f3de7a126f5f255be44e", "ja": "でもさ、ただ待ってるのもタイクツだろ？\nそれに、みんなで探した方が絶対早いって！", "zh": "可是啊，一直待在原地等很无聊嘛！\n而且大家一起找绝对比较快啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae3f3fa3c7c8af9b91a86b8dc62b13dd850f46308f145658b9507725ca7d682f", "ja": "ま、何かあったら連絡すれば大丈夫っしょ。\n……あっ！？　ねえねえ、あの子スゴくない！？", "zh": "哎呀，反正有状况再联络他就行啦。\n……啊！？你们快看，那个女生也太正了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "2144c2eaab7370377d3c49a66310b65549d9a015fcb2e629e5040ff29f43b3f6", "ja": "え？　なに、また有名人？\n……うわあっ！？　ホントだ、すっげー！", "zh": "咦？什么，又遇到名人了吗？\n……哇！？真的耶，好正喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "5e9f4e452c584ccb8dc537e35cf8628ff748db5e366a1f2e522087ef37eceba3", "ja": "め、恵美ちゃん、昴ちゃん……！\nそんなにジロジロ見たら、し、失礼だよ……！", "zh": "惠、惠美、小昴……！\n不要一直盯着人家看，太、太没礼貌了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "92fc3afb8e5bc1bba6231f31a5266604b554cc3fe90901c54ab2c83dc199e997", "ja": "いいから、可憐も見てみなって！　ほらほら！", "zh": "不会啦，可怜你先看看再说！来啦来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1039_201xxx", "source_sha256": "c60f6b05d9fbaf5c50ac1d4af78ad7820dd24a8bd61760d6c39b08e93e68f42d", "ja": "はい、わかりました。\n今日はよろしくお願いしますね♪", "zh": "好的，我知道了。\n那今天就麻烦你了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1040_staff", "source_sha256": "b9d03552c8b6a15b2350e6817734c8e3c67d9f45605a432191d6b1747203968d", "ja": "は……はい！\nこ、こちらこそ、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "好……好的！\n彼、彼此彼此，也请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "68b645d41b64e53e785fa2e9a3a0fb04ab9c648771e95c02cf2b73378f4079af", "ja": "うわ～……！", "zh": "哇喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
