{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1044_035hin", "source_sha256": "4a99be531dabb8436cc889325487ede26adb9fd0b5037a77a83b362cbbbeba8f", "ja": "ひゃあ～……！", "zh": "呀啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1045_045kar", "source_sha256": "3c58010d1d59254cf5bae6c51aa47afcd1916e15c984efd0a3d2f8f56031bf7f", "ja": "う、うわぁ……。", "zh": "哇、哇啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1046_020meg", "source_sha256": "dab0931262fe40b97c0c0088b6d4ef8f7a4886bf6d476ffed8ed95bad17986ec", "ja": "ね、すっごい美少女だよね、ね！\nモデルでもあんな子、見たことないよ～！", "zh": "看到没？是超正的美少女，对吧！\n在模特儿界也没见过像她那样的女生耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1047_035hin", "source_sha256": "c2aaa33364b2e759a63ccffeeee044ef533b947b549109c8fdb302417ccfda4d", "ja": "や～、なまらキレイな人だねぇ！\n周りの空気まで、キラキラしてるみたいだべさ……！", "zh": "哇～真是漂亮的人呢～！\n有种自带聚光灯的感觉哪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1048_047sub", "source_sha256": "fa922d6235058c80e2d3efb29cc23f2d35f1d934437d2e38f63f3e2a1e80dbda", "ja": "うう……見てるだけなのに、なんかオレ……\nドキドキしてきたかも～！", "zh": "呜呜……我明明只是看着……\n却有种心动的感觉～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1049_026yur", "source_sha256": "f817f1b773a6849cdf15d1a6d3d5476ffdfc3a8d0d70723375353d8f12d3114f", "ja": "ほ、本当に私たちと同じ、アイドルなんでしょうか…？\n普通の人じゃないみたいです。もっとこう高次の……！", "zh": "她、她真的也跟我们一样是偶像吗……？\n看起来不像是普通人，而是更高次元的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1050_045kar", "source_sha256": "7c6415a3e76240a8f874a875a5548795e35f17aedf5f490a93568d16cc3a6bec", "ja": "は、離れてるのに……\nすごくいい匂いが、してきます……！", "zh": "明、明明离得很远……\n却可以闻到，好香的味道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1051_047sub", "source_sha256": "1e2e7929c6aed90180dc323c2716fdea19e9a64be745f59ab7fef3ad2bcff3f5", "ja": "あっ……ど、どっか行っちゃう！\nなあ、みんな！　追いかけてみようぜ！", "zh": "啊……她、她要走掉了！\n走吧，大家！我们追上去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1052_026yur", "source_sha256": "2501d465cfdf507cff6192b92a9678d84fc70861011642cdb064dcc79027564e", "ja": "ええっ！？　確かに気になりますけど……\nい、いいのかな？", "zh": "什么！？虽然她确实很令人在意……\n但、但是这样好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1053_047sub", "source_sha256": "24c94d2fc1eb9cece3efc82293ba037fc0409bd17d33bfe2b09f069bcd3bdbb3", "ja": "あ、見失っちゃう！　ほらっ、早く早く！", "zh": "啊，她要不见了！走嘛，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1054_p", "source_sha256": "fe52275baaec0947f38869d28e4e58f5e19b128f5d17059ea623f9f37ab918de", "ja": "（……参ったな。スタッフが見付からない。\nステージの方なら、いるかな……行ってみるか）", "zh": "（……伤脑筋，找不到工作人员。\n舞台那边会有吗……去看看吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1055_201xxx", "source_sha256": "2b0afb7da9de1a43c1ff4e2dfb3c3ffcfc2a29afe6552709887c578ec61a5462", "ja": "あの……？", "zh": "请问……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1056_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1057_201xxx", "source_sha256": "2252079fa426d890115435a7b3ffcb27ccc4948cd29fedf412cbec01803ba9c6", "ja": "グリュース・ゴット♪\n……なにかお困りですか？", "zh": "Grüß Gott♪\n……请问你需要帮忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1058_p", "source_sha256": "aa5ae7f15adbd3566146116cb80e84415d07de7588279b8c65fcbcb83937d598", "ja": "（うわっ！？　な、なんだこの子は！？\nこの声……容姿……いや、とにかくオーラがすごい！）", "zh": "（哇！？这、这个女孩是什么来头！？\n她的声音……容貌……不，整个气场都让我惊为天人！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1059_201xxx", "source_sha256": "7ebede70796faa47d509c2034ccd70fea393aea253b9dced683760eb5d02a20e", "ja": "……。\nあの？　もしもし？", "zh": "……\n不好意思？有听到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1060_p", "source_sha256": "352700629d5028b9116dd9e28c1995a08a9e95057b154b2f0ef296a7abe08878", "ja": "あ……ああ、ごめん！　気圧されてしまって……。\nええと、俺はこういう者です。", "zh": "啊……啊啊，抱歉！我被震慑住了……\n呃，这是我的名片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_1061", "source_sha256": "b17ca4d3bdeeeaffbc5d36b1c3d7e7fd69390b707c28e7d3c021eca0bf941d3d", "ja": "名刺を渡す", "zh": "递出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "883c00773032463f976eac3791d7893ab7490e0f2a9edeb805ba2a4593ef0c44", "ja": "（はっ、スカウトのときのクセで、つい名刺を……！\nまあいいか。それにしても、この子は一体……？）", "zh": "（呃，平常发掘偶像太习惯，顺手就递出名片了……！\n算了。话说回来，这女孩究竟是……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2001_201xxx", "source_sha256": "13f8340b1da45ee3fa435a548a57ef4164b89968d6a8d917eff0347ea346d254", "ja": "！　765プロの、プロデューサーさん……！？\nそうだったんですね！　お会いできて光栄です！", "zh": "啊！你是765艺能的制作人先生……！？\n原来是这样啊！很荣幸能见到你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2002_p", "source_sha256": "c440163ec4e6a47c1857843cea2d413e30c95099d1b67871404d50b146db5152", "ja": "え？　光栄って、何が……？", "zh": "咦？荣幸？什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2003_045kar", "source_sha256": "fe9a7312b9a205cf33016acde2ab4dbcd3299f617a6123db938db807256468b7", "ja": "くんくん……こっちの方から、匂いが……。", "zh": "嗅嗅……气味在这个方向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2004_047sub", "source_sha256": "73b0ad665853583112e2febb6f0f93660e59bf71ee80be4d47051f8649fdab43", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nなあ今、こっちにかわいい子が来なかっ……", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n我问你喔，刚刚有没有看到一个可爱女生经过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2005_047sub", "source_sha256": "38d0f855804133f902ae9f59d1a8778f864a065ebce92316d8356c167a97e537", "ja": "うわああっ、いたああああ！", "zh": "哇啊啊，就在这里啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2006_p", "source_sha256": "fefd3139d21d7dfe188262ae6d6801212daa24e731cb3143704cc925abe9e514", "ja": "可憐に、昴……みんなもか。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "可怜、昴……还有大家都来了，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2007_020meg", "source_sha256": "887fa7bd0d58504715afb7f8069a98e5edc284859df8efabd6dd8444a689437d", "ja": "{$P$}こそ、どうしたの！？\nどうしてその美少女ちゃんと話してるワケ？", "zh": "{$P$}才是，怎么回事！？\n为什么你和那位美少女在聊天啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2008_026yur", "source_sha256": "8627e39690ab3e3ffb42693ad9db7f297063b9694558238ef25d2db9c0aa0f65", "ja": "そ、その高次な存在の方と、\nお知り合いだったんですか！？", "zh": "难、难道那位高次元的存在，\n是你认识的人吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2009_p", "source_sha256": "a8c9acd93228539aef56fee62afe631d192c017492cbd95d460102f6af91b624", "ja": "こ、高次……？\nいや、俺もこの子とは、今会ったばかりだけど……。", "zh": "高、高次元……？\n不是啊，我也是刚刚才遇到她而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2010_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6cb63e845ef6cdf275065d7c2b897167d396410ebbd0af2991ad62d35746fb6a", "ja": "ふふっ♪　765プロのみなさんですね！\nお会いできて、本当に嬉しいです。", "zh": "呵呵♪各位是765艺能的偶像吧！\n很开心能见到你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_01_2011_201xxx", "source_sha256": "00c9ab7650190b9161c22833a088c4cb8e19dfc068c153cf4c58329bc73ab661", "ja": "グリュース・ゴット♪　私、詩花って言います。\n961プロの、アイドルです♪", "zh": "Grüß Gott♪\n我叫做诗花，是961艺能的偶像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
